+/* Read-only: the device-authored ETE send/flag words (+0xC00/+0xC18) and the
+ * firmware-owned DR source-ring state.  Added by the wifi-ete-init lane
+ * (task-81) to answer "does the vendor ETE init run / does the engine pump"
